window.products.push({"id":533106,"name":"VINGLI Power Lift Chair Recliners for Elderly Electric Lift Chair with Massage,Faux Leather Massage Recliner for Living Room,USB Charge Port,Side Pock","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DBfWMouvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"➤Power Lift Chairs Recliners as Mobility Aid:Looking for a power lift chair?try our electric lift recliners.It's an ideal solution for anybody who has difficulty transitioning from a seated position to standing due to limited mobility or balance issues.Our lift chairs recliners can slowly push your chair up to help you stand up easily without adding pressure to back or knees. ➤Hight Quality Material :To offer utmost support and comfort,we adopt high quality material and heavy-duty steel frame which ensures its stability.High-density foam are filled to provide overstuffed backrest,armrest and seating area making you feel more relaxed.Seat Dimensions - 20.5\"D x 21.3\"W,Seat Height:18.5\". Max reclining angle: 140°. Please kindly check the size info before purchasing. ➤Massage Recliners with 8 Points:Our electric lift chairs come with 8 points focused on your calf,thigh,waist,neck,5 types of intensity and 8 different massage modes can well accommodate to your demand.You can also set up your massage time in 15/30 minutes.Please noted that our recliners DOES NOT have heating function. ➤Easy to Use:With an easy touch on the button, it can be lifted in an upright position or reclined to different angles for maximum comfort.The back recliner and foot recliner will move simultaneously,the chair will stop once you release the button.Extra USB port allows you charge your phone or ipad when you're reclining,which provides more convenience. ➤Ships in 2 Boxes:This lift reclining chair comes with 2 large separated packages,delivery time may vary per box. Easy assembly is required upon arrival,anyone can do this within 30 minutes,just slide the back and arm of chair into the seat brackets and finish the wire connections.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DBfWMouvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VINGLI","source_asin":"B08X628BGQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-533106","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08X628BGQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08X628BGQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
