window.products.push({"id":533212,"name":"Costzon Kids Recliner, Gaming Recliner Chair w/Footrest, Headrest & Lumbar Support, Ergonomic Leather Lounge Chair for Living & Gaming Room, Adjustabl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":129.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Wb4Y-kzYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Gaming Style as a Great Gift: Super soft kids recliner is designed in trendy colors for a cool racing style, perfectly integrated with gaming atmosphere. Add this modern and practical furniture to your living room, kids play room or bedroom, giving your kids a comfortable relaxing zone of their own. Sitting & Lying Sofa Recliner: From upright sitting to reclining sleeping, your little child can lean back from 100 to 160 degrees. The backrest and footrest are extended or retracted simultaneously. Therefore, it can save room space without the need to place sofa and recliner at the same time. Sturdy Structure & Easy to Move: Made from a strong solid wood frame and safe and odorless material, this kids recliner chair is stable and durable with a load capacity of 165 lbs. Four anti-slip and scratch-resistant sofa feet make it suitable to set on carpet, floor, etc. And it is easy to assemble and move, saving you time and energy. Ergonomic and Humanized Design: The headrest and lumbar support can provide extra support to relieve fatigue. The soft seat with high-density sponge and lining springs would bring more comfort. With waterproof PU leather, when your kids spill out the juicy food or beverage, you can easily clean it with a damp cloth! Good Companion: The spacious seating space is very suitable for kids over 3 years old. Your kids can play games, read books, watch TV or take a nap on this sofa recliner to spend a happy childhood. With 16 inches seat height, your kids can climb up and down easily.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Wb4Y-kzYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Costzon","source_asin":"B08QZGH5TQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-533212","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08QZGH5TQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08QZGH5TQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
