window.products.push({"id":533250,"name":"Young's Northwood Sweet Black Bear Holding \"Believe\" Sign Resin Figurine","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51WA9Oa4reL._AC_.jpg","description":"This delightful bear figurine is part of the NORTHWOOD BEAR collection and features a hand painted resin BLACK BEAR holding an oval sign that reads \"BELIEVE\"! These are designed to look like real carved wood and many, like this one, are wearing real black and white knitted scarves! This particular figurine comes in five other designs. If you like bears or woodland themed items, then you'll love this wonderful collection, complete with dozens of other unique items! Measures 3.5\" High. By Young's, Inc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51WA9Oa4reL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Young's Inc","source_asin":"B018D8WKI0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-533250","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B018D8WKI0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B018D8WKI0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":533251,"name":"Summit Outdoor Wine Glasses, Vacuum Insulated Wine Tumbler With Lid, Stemless Metal Cup Design, Stainless Steel, Unbreakable, Shatterproof, Portable, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71H7XzELb2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"About Us: We are blessed to call Fort Collins, Colorado our home.  Our goal is to create products for all of the adventures that life may call you to - camping, climbing a 14er, or maybe just relaxing by a river.  We want these products to be durable, easy to clean, and also enhance whatever beverage you choose to consume. Thank you for investing in our products and we hope that you are able to slow down, fully savor life and enjoy everyday moments, wherever your journey may take you. Summit Legacy: To live life with wonder and awe and enjoy all of the adventures that you encounter, even the ones that challenge you and push you beyond your limits as you continue to climb towards your destination.  The goal isn't always about reaching the summit but what we learn along the way. When we are challenged, we become who we were created to be. Most people think of a legacy as physical things that we leave behind.  Legacy is our story.  How we live our life and how we complete the work that has been set out before us. The impact that we have on others, those that we love, and the people we have yet to meet, in a way that is positive, encouraging and motivating.  We are connected through our stories. Quality and Performance: Pro-grade 18/8 stainless steel to protect against flavor transfer Pro-grade 18/8 stainless steel to protect against flavor transfer Advanced vacuum insulated technology to keep your drink the perfect temperature longer Advanced vacuum insulated technology to keep your drink the perfect temperature longer No heat transfer or condensation to the outside of the glass No heat transfer or condensation to the outside of the glass Powder coated exterior to provide additional texture and durability Powder coated exterior to provide additional texture and durability Removable BPA free lid to protect against outdoor elements Removable BPA free lid to protect against outdoor elements","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71H7XzELb2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Summit Legacy Products","source_asin":"B07235HKBW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-533251","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07235HKBW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07235HKBW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":533252,"name":"Home Basics Mesa Collection Scratch-Resistant Nylon Kitchen Tool, Black (Whisk)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/511UnA3qWTL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"From whipping up cream to beating eggs, this balloon shaped whisk features silicone wires that are as robust as a standard steel whisks, but are gentle enough not to scratch delicate pots, pans, and mixing bowls. The multiple wires are thick, sturdy and flexible to quickly smooth out lumps from mixtures. The soft nylon wires are great to use on all types of materials, from delicate ceramic and enamel to stainless steel without causing damage to your expensive cookware and bakeware. The smooth stainless steel handle is substantially built and fits comfortable in your hand to take the strain from frequent mixing. And with a convenient hanging hole to store away when not in use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/511UnA3qWTL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home Basics","source_asin":"B07KWFTV5L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-533252","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KWFTV5L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KWFTV5L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
