window.products.push({"id":533257,"name":"LINKROMAT Lighted Birch Trees, 4FT 5FT 6FT(48 56 96LED) Pre-lit Birch Tree with Warm White, Artificial Birch Tree Outdoor/Indoor Christmas Easter Tree","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":95.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91AapuPvXsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🎄Birch Trees with Lights: Easter Christmas Birch Tree Lights, 48pcs 56pcs 96pcs warm white LED lights are inlaid on a 4ft 5ft 6ft tall outdoor Christmas tree with a lifespan of up to 30,000 hours. From 9th November 2022, our birch wrap will come with 24 maple leaves, 24 colored balls and 200 cherry blossoms as an extra Christmas gift to create an elegant holiday look for your home bedroom, Add warmth to the living room or any environment. 🎄Exquisite Birch Details: 3-pack lighted birch trees are covered with bark textured tape for a birch look, the invisible lines are well hidden inside the tree, and the branches are dotted with warm white lights. You just plug it in to get the lights on, and the package includes power adapters. The prelit birch tree is sturdy enough, and the square stand base is stable. 4FT prelit trees base size: 7\" X 7\" (LXW); 5FT birch tree base size: 7.8\" X 7.8\" (LXW); 6FT tree base size: 8.6\" X 8.6\" (LXW) 🎄Flexible DIY Branches: Unlike the non-bendable branches on the market, our LED birch tree has carefully designed shapes and bendable branches, you can bend branches and trees into any shape or more natural DIY shape according to your needs. The branches are strong enough to hang small decorations such as bells, colorful bars, Easter eggs, gift cartons, etc., to create a romantic and dreamy lighting atmosphere for your home, and window display. 🎄Festive Decoration with a Sense of Atmosphere: Art comes from creative interest, and warm white lighted birch trees can create a natural and romantic atmosphere. Perfect for various occasions or holiday decorations, such as Easter in spring, Thanksgiving in autumn and Christmas in winter, not only that, but also very suitable for indoor and outdoor use, such as home, wedding, garden, bedroom, living room, party, Lobby. The perfect decoration for your home to add a festive touch to your home. 🎄Easy Assembly and Size: The outdoor lighted Christmas tree is easy to assemble, take out the tree stand, screw the trunk clockwise into the base, taking care to connect the male grooves correctly. The package comes with clear and detailed instructions, if you have any questions, please feel free to contact us, we will solve the problem for you within 24 hours. Birch size: 4FT 5FT 6FT (about 47\", 59\", 70\" from top to tree foundation)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91AapuPvXsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LINKROMAT","source_asin":"B0BLSDLCMM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-533257","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLSDLCMM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLSDLCMM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
