window.products.push({"id":533268,"name":"Provence Soft Cotton Floral Chair Cushion with Ties in French Country Style, 15'' x 15'', Lilac Rose","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rQPy+ew7L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"ABOUT THE PRODUCTA beautiful, thick and very soft chair cushion in classic French country pattern. These incredibly soft chair seat pads are covered in gorgeous purple and lilac roses. A special blend of cotton and polyester ensures that chair cushions by Provence are durable and machine washable. These chair pads are a part of a large collection of french country decor for the home. You can find matching shabby chic and french country accessories and always purchase more coordinated products to decorate your whole kitchen and add a little something French to it.WASHING TIPS Wash with cold water in gentle cycle adding 3 tennis balls & tumble dry low with no heat. For best results, wash separately the first use to minimize lint.GREAT GIFT OPTIONThis classy stylish kitchen chair cushion is a perfect gift for Mother's day, birthday, holidays, housewarming, hostess gift and more.ABOUT THE BRANDProvence is a French decor brand that specializes in producing high-quality home textiles and interior décor accessories, offering our customers not only a wide range of bedding, tablecloths, shabby chic kitchen curtains, aprons, etc., but also complete interior solutions for the kitchen improvement, bedroom or living room.Most of the products from our collections are designed in the style of French Country and Shabby Chic. Its distinctive features are: pastel fabrics and natural hues, natural materials, a variety of floral motifs and floral patterns (lavender, small rose, various bouquets). In general, this style - it is a synonym for warmth and comfort, lightness and poetry that embodies the traditions and family heirlooms. Many would agree that Provence is not just a style, it’s a way of life.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rQPy+ew7L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Provence","source_asin":"B0756NZWV1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-533268","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0756NZWV1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0756NZWV1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
