window.products.push({"id":533504,"name":"Adam’s Premium Foam Cannon Soap Combo - Custom Snow Foam Cannon Soap Sprayer for Car Wash | Sprayer Cannister for Pressure Washer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":78.19,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61nhWDVfubL._AC_SL1027_.jpg","description":"✅ PROFESSIONAL DESIGN, DUAL ADJUSTABLE SPRAY FAN - Designed with extreme attention to detail and industry leading features including a dual adjustable spray fan for vertical and horizontal adjustments, wide fill canister to prevent tips and spills, upgraded brass & stainless steel fittings, and a versatile foaming nozzle that fits regular bottles and the wide body canister. ✅ A CAR DETAILING NECESSITY - Improve the efficiency of your car cleaning routine by adding a pressure wash foam cannon. The Foam Lance is simply a tool every detailing enthusiast should have. Layers of foam create lubricity and help reduce the chances of harming your vehicles paint, wheels, trim, or other delicate surfaces. ✅ HIGH VOLUME CANISTER OR ATTACH ADAMS 16OZ BOTTLES DIRECTLY - Holding more than 32oz of liquid, add car wash soap like Adams Mega Foam with water to create blankets of foam! Now you can attach bottles directly to your foam cannon! Get every last drop out of your Car Shampoo or attach other foaming chemicals like Adam’s All Purpose Cleaner to foam your engine bay & undercarriage! ✅ MAKE CAR CLEANING EASY WITH A THICK LAYER OF FOAM - Pressurized water & car wash soap create a thick layer of foam. A pressure washer is required when using Adam’s Foam Cannon 2.0. It is important to note that you cannot use a standard garden hose like with our Foam Gun. PRO TIP! Use for jobs around the house like cleaning walk ways, windows or siding cleaning on your home. ✅ 110% SATISFACTION GUARANTEE - At Adam’s, we strive to bring the BEST car cleaning supplies, auto detailing kits, washing accessories, microfiber towels, waxes, sealants, ceramic coatings, mops, brushes, mitts, sponges, garage tools, applicators & other quality products. If you are not satisfied, let us know & we’ll do everything we can to make it right!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61nhWDVfubL._AC_SL1027_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Adam's Polishes","source_asin":"B08M2NK5WQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-533504","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08M2NK5WQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08M2NK5WQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
