window.products.push({"id":533512,"name":"KANBIT Small Travel Alarm Clock Battery Operated Silent No Ticking Beep Sounds Loud Analog Alarm Clock with Snooze & Light, Easy to Set Desk Clock for","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ox2A2J7EL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Large Number Display:Our High-quality small travel alarm clock battery operated comes with a large bold number clock face that makes it easy to read the time from a distance, perfect for seniors. The analog clock also keeps accurate time, ensuring that you’re always on schedule! Easy to Set:Our simply travel analog alarm clock is very easy to set with the knobs on the back. You can rotate the knob to set the desired time and alarm. The alarm function can be easily turn on/off with a simple switch. The alarm clock has a gentle beep sound that gradually become more rapid, making it easy to wake you up. Completely Silent Analog Clock:This small battery clock features a super quiet, concise design without any annoying ticking sound. It is perfect choice for those who need a peaceful sleep environment. Night Light with Snooze Function: The luminous hands glow in the dark. You can simply hold the top button to light up the small clock on demand. And the night light button illuminates a friendly yellow light for clear viewing without disturbing your partner. Multi-Purpose:This small analog clock is suitable for many occasions such as the bedroom, during travel, in the bathroom, in the living room, on your nightstand, at your office desk, and more. Its compact size allows it to be easily take to any place without taking up too much space. After Sales Services: The small analog clock is operated by 1*AA battery. All our KANBIT products sold are covered by a one-year warranty. If you have any questions or concerns, Please email us through Amazon buyer centre, we will reply you as soon as possible within 24 hours. We are trying our best to satisfy our valued customers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ox2A2J7EL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KANBIT","source_asin":"B0BWX9Y9DJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-533512","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BWX9Y9DJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BWX9Y9DJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
