window.products.push({"id":533651,"name":"3 Piece Reversible Summer Quilt Set Stitched Bedspread Twin/TXL Size, Lightweight Bedding Comforter Coverlet Set filled with Cotton, Soft Microfiber C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zgx1zqhDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【PREMIUM QUILTED COVERLET SET FOR DURABLE COMFORT】 Different from those ultrasonic stitched quilts, our coverlet set adopts high-cost thread sewing to tightly fix the outer layer fabric and the inner filling together which can effectively prevent the coverlet from unravel. The neat stitches increase the durability of the quilt comforter set and keeps the thickness of the quilt uniform. We’ve lovingly and carefully crafted your bedspread so you can enjoy many years of luxurious comfort 【ELEGANT EMBROIDERED FLORAL PATTERN】Features a sophisticated design of stitched floral pattern, our exquisite quilt set will beautifully complement your bedroom or guest bedroom décor. The versatile floral motif suits a simple classic home, a rustic country aesthetic and will work perfectly with a shabby chic charm. This is the coverlet set for all styles and all seasons. 【LIGHTWEIGHT & SOFT SUMMER DUVET】 Our breathable quilted set filled with 100% cotton in a weight of 200 gram per ㎡ is super lightweight and has good performance in air permeability, so it is a good choice as summer duvet as it won’t retain too much heat causing you to toss and turn during sleep. Encased in premium microfiber fabric and treated with washing process for ultimate in softness, our bedspread will give you the best sleep experience and help you relieve the tiredness of the whole day. 【COMPLETE SET FOR MULTI PURPOSE USAGE】Available in 3 Pieces Twin/Twin XL Quilt Set: 1 Quilt (68\"x86\") , 2 Pillow Shams (20\"x26\"). You can enjoy it in the bedroom, on the sofa in the living room or use it as bedding set in your RV. Moreover, the quilt is suitable for all seasons. You can simply use it on its own in spring and summer, or use it as a bedspread or coverlet in autumn and winter. All these make the quilt set become a great gift choice. 【EASY CARE】 Easy Care. We’ve expertly designed our quilt set so it’s fade, stain, shrink and wrinkle resistant. No need for costly dry cleaners – simply machine wash your quilt and shams on a cold wash and use a tumble dryer on low and it’ll dry in no time at all. If you have any queries, please contact us and we’ll help you asap. *Due to the use of vacuum package, the quilt will arrive shriveled and wrinkled, please wash and dry it to puff it and remove the wrinkles.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zgx1zqhDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"D & G THE DUCK AND GOOSE CO","source_asin":"B099K6LPPC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-533651","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B099K6LPPC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B099K6LPPC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
