window.products.push({"id":533877,"name":"Elyon Tableware 20-piece Black Flatware, Stainless Steel Silverware Set, Reflective Mirror Finish Cutlery Set, Reusable Dishwasher Safe, Service For 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.77,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cFXrFCJXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Design - This silverware set will complement any of your existing tableware. Each utensil is designed with smooth edges and rounded bottom to feel right in your hands, weighted to perfection for maximum comfort while in use. Quality - The black mirror silverware is titanium plated, which provides a durable finish preventing the utensils from fading and tarnishing over time. The set is constructed of 18/0 durable stainless steel, designed to hold its shape without bending. Usage - This beautiful reflective stainless steel black plated flatware set is sure to impress your guests. It is perfect for parties, restaurants, or date nights at home. Host friends and enjoy your meal with this modern set, or gift it to a friend so they can serve in style. Care - To maintain the excellent condition of your flatware set, we recommend washing it by hand with regular household detergent. Avoid using heavy-duty scouring pads such as steel wool, which can scratch and damage the set. Although dishwasher-safe, lemon and acidic dishwasher detergents should not be used on the set. After washing, be sure to dry the set completely to prevent any water stains. Satisfaction Guaranteed - We hope you enjoy using this set as much as we do. Please contact us if you are not completely satisfied with this product. Includes - 4 x Dinner Spoon, 4 x Dinner Fork, 4 x Knife, 4 x Dessert Spoon, 4 x Salad Fork.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cFXrFCJXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Elyon Tableware","source_asin":"B07KNTSP34","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-533877","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KNTSP34","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KNTSP34","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":533878,"name":"Chic Home Josepha 7 Piece Sherpa Comforter Set Beige / King","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.88,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FILW8-f4L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Treat yourself with this gorgeous super plush, super warm Sherpa comforter set with sheet set and shams. Made with a new technique that highlights a pinch pleat style with ruffled and pleated details. Stunning colors guaranteed to enhance any room or decor all year round. Specifications Available In: Beige, Black, Brown, Grey, Navy Blue, Olive Green, Red Sizes:Queen, King Queen Set Includes â¢ 1pc Comforter (86â x 92â) â¢ 2pc Shams (20â x 26â) â¢ 1pc Flat Sheet (90â x 102â + 4â) â¢ 1pc Fitted Sheet (60â x 80â x 12â) â¢ 2pc Pillow Cases (20â x 30â) King Set Includes â¢ 1pc Comforter (104â x 92â) â¢ 2pc Shams (20â x 36â) â¢ 1pc Flat Sheet (108â x 102â + 4â) â¢ 1pc Fitted Sheet (78â x 80â x 12â) â¢ 2pc Pillow Cases (20â x 40â) Fabric and Design â¢ Silky soft microplush and Sherpa lining material â¢ Sophisticated and elegant pinch pleated ruffled pintuck look Highlights â¢ Luxuriously soft feel for a great night sleep with less tossing and turning â¢ Hypoallergenic alternative down filling is perfect for those allergic to traditional down materials â¢ Built to last with premium fabrics and expert stitching Care Instructions Dry clean preferred. Machine washable, use front loader machine (or top loader without agitator) to avoid tearing, use cold water on gentle cycle, tumble dry low * Add 2 tennis balls to the dryer to speed up drying and add fluffiness Additional Info â¢ Please review our shipping and return policy prior to placing your order. â¢ Some items depicted in our digital images are props and are not included as part of the listing. Please refer to the product description for a list of what is included as part of this listing. â¢ The digital images we display have the most accurate color possible. However, due to differences in viewing settings, we cannot be responsible for slight variations in color between your screen and the actual product. If you have any questions about anything related to this listing, e.g., the product details, our shipping policy or our return policy, please contact us prior to placing your order.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FILW8-f4L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chic Home","source_asin":"B016N08TNA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-533878","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B016N08TNA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B016N08TNA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
